<title>NEW ZEALAND: Sky City expects 3 millionth visitor.</title>
<headline>Sky City expects 3 millionth visitor.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sky City Ltd said on Wednesday it was preparing to welcome its three millionth visitor later this week.</p>
<p>Earlier this month Sky City announced 1.9 million casino visitations in the five month trading period to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
